146
00:18:29,000 --> 00:18:33,000
Agriculture usually follows the cheapest successful path.

147
00:18:33,000 --> 00:18:41,000
Once cattle, sheep, and goats filled the dairy niche, competing species had to offer something better. Pig milk never

148
00:18:41,000 --> 00:18:52,000
