152
00:19:15,000 --> 00:19:25,000
Pathogens may enter through infection of the mammary gland, fecal contamination, dirty equipment, the environment, or handling.

153
00:19:25,000 --> 00:19:32,000
Pasteurization reduces the risk by heating milk under controlled conditions. Modern cow milk is safe

