00:21:42,000 --> 00:21:51,000
milk never accumulated those pieces at large scale. And once a food tradition fails to form, disgust can fill the empty space. Ask someone who grew up

172
00:21:51,000 --> 00:21:59,000
drinking cow milk whether cow milk is strange. Usually, no. Now, describe the process without naming the animal. A reproductive secretion from a large

