174
00:22:09,000 --> 00:22:12,000
Suddenly, the normal thing sounds experimental.

175
00:22:12,000 --> 00:22:19,000
Humans learn food categories as children. Milk comes from cows. Eggs come from chickens. Meat comes from

176
00:22:19,000 --> 00:22:26,000
